      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-45591",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the linear function $l(x) = 9x + 10$ and the exponential function $e(x) = 3^{x}$, where $x$ is a positive integer. At which value of $x$ does the exponential function first exceed the linear function?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
